dpdpa-guard scans the new code. It detects that the feature accesses a field called order_items which is tagged in the data dictionary as containing health-adjacent purchase data. It checks the purpose registry. It finds that the declared purpose for this data is order_fulfilment. The new feature's purpose is personalised_health_recommendations. These do not match.

